title: 'Hypothesis: Copy pressing unsolved ideas into a ''still processing'' collection when reviewing notes.'
pid: 4dff56e9-2838-4530-969b-0f82b9f77feb
body: |2-
  For instance, after breaking up with Lorena,
  I reviewed lots of notes (passion, wholeness, honor, feelings ...)
  and only at the very end started copying the especially useful-seeming
  notes into a collection to continue processing.
  I wished I had been doing that the whole time --
  so much so that I reread them to do it.
